(function() {
            P.when('cr-A', 'ready').execute(function(A) {
                if(typeof A.toggleExpanderAriaLabel === 'function') {
                    A.toggleExpanderAriaLabel('review_text_read_more', 'Read more of this review', 'Read less of this review');
                }
            });
        })();


        .review-text-read-more-expander:focus-visible {
            outline: 2px solid #2162a1;
            outline-offset: 2px;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }











    Great phone with processor and camera!Really enjoyed software which is ultra smooth on 120hz display! Color brightness is as expected in sunlight. Fingerprint sensor dynamic fast. Only thing which i felt is little downside is battery. Battery drains very fast. In this price segment samsung could have offered 5000 mah.All good. Premium feel.

